# Always deploy to Staging

After implementing or fixing anything in this hub, run:

```bash
bash ~/impect-football-dashboard/deploy-staging.sh
```

from `~/impect-football-dashboard` only. Do not wait to be asked.

- Staging: http://178.128.161.215:8080/ — safe verify. Does not touch Live.
- Live: only when the user explicitly asks (`deploy-live.sh`).
- Do not mark the task complete after local-only changes.
- Staging is not “done for staff.”
